flipendo: fixes to SurrealEngine bugs (any game): VM, properties, ini files, packages (Unicode strings), crash reports, music streaming and following the default audio device (and an optional linear sound falloff, off unless a game asks), BSP regions, travel of fixed arrays and struct properties; a GotoState from inside EndState sends no second EndState and the outer call stops (movement mod: Wingardium release overflowed the stack)

